OL,3,GNEWSAWarning of more lane closures
OL,4,Aduring Thickthorn work
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists have been warned to expect
OL,7,Fdisruption for nearly a year as an
OL,8,Funderpass is built during the next
OL,9,Fphase of a major roadworks scheme.
OL,11,FThe westbound A47 exit slip road of the
OL,12,FThickthorn roundabout on the outskirts
OL,13,Fof Norwich will go down from three
OL,14,Flanes to one from 06:00 GMT on Monday,
OL,15,Ffor 11 months.
OL,17,FConstruction work for the underpass and
OL,18,Fa new one-mile link road will require
OL,19,Fremoving about 80,000 cubic metres of
OL,20,Fearth between the A47 and the A11.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
