OL,3,GNEWSAWarning of more lane closures
OL,4,Aduring Thickthorn work
OL,5,
OL,6,FChris Griffin, National Highways
OL,7,Fproject lead, said: "We are doing
OL,8,Feverything we can to minimise the
OL,9,Fimpact of this and we will see
OL,10,Fsignificant benefits once it is
OL,11,Fcompleted."
